  "_comment": "Lab test name → calculator field mapping. Copy this file to lab-mappings.json and customize for your institution's lab report format.",
  "_instructions": "Each key is a lab test name as it appears in your lab reports (supports Chinese/English). Each value is an array of target objects: { field: 'calculator-input-id', transform: 'threshold:>19' }. The transform field is optional; use 'threshold:>N' to convert to binary 0/1 based on a cutoff.",
